        <title>Zsh 配置体系体检与优化：启动链路分析</title>
        <published>2026-08-11T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2026-08-11T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>Suchaharcan</name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://suchaharcan.github.io/03Share_blog/zsh-config-optimization/"/>
